#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your skills in practical quantum computing, and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "IBM Trainingサイトで20問の試験を受け、実践的な量子コンピューティングのスキルをテストし、Credlyを通じてバッジを取得しましょう。"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Quantum computing in practice"
msgstr "試験 | 実践における量子コンピューティング"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "試験とバッジ {#exam-and-badge}"

